        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Unit 13 - Environment</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #e9e9e9;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      color: #111;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      background: white;\n      padding: 10px 27px 11px 37px;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .topline {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .15px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      margin-bottom: 13px;\n    }\n    .unit { margin-left: 4px; }\n    .exercise-row {\n      position: relative;\n      padding-left: 39px;\n      margin-bottom: 9px;\n    }\n    .badge {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: 0;\n      width: 22px;\n      height: 22px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #98bd18;\n      color: #032b61;\n      border: 1px solid #7da315;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 22px;\n      text-shadow: 1px 1px #d7ee53;\n    }\n    .instruction {\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      line-height: 15px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      padding-top: 2px;\n    }\n    .phrase-box {\n      margin: 8px 10px 10px 8px;\n      border: 1px solid #777;\n      width: 381px;\n      height: 39px;\n      padding: 4px 8px;\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      line-height: 14px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 136px 150px 1fr;\n      grid-template-rows: 14px 14px;\n      column-gap: 0