2px;\n      line-height: 12px;\n    }\n    .word-grid div { white-space: nowrap; }\n    .word-grid .top { color: #777; font-style: italic; }\n\n    .make-list {\n      margin-top: 5px;\n    }\n    .handwriting {\n      height: 14px;\n      margin: 0 0 2px 88px;\n      color: #8c493d;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      transform: rotate(-2deg);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      opacity: .9;\n    }\n    .chart-section { margin-top: 7px; }\n    .chart-section .instruction { width: 420px; }\n    .questions {\n      margin: 7px 0 7px 0;\n      font-size: 13.3px;\n      line-height: 14px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    table {\n      width: 478px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    th, td {\n      border: 1px solid #7c8493;\n    }\n    th {\n      height: 20px;\n      background: #e7f5fa;\n      color: #141b4a;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    td { height: 62px; }\n    th:nth-child(1) { width: 148px; }\n    th:nth-child(2) { width: 90px; }\n    th:nth-child(3) { width: 150px; }\n    th:nth-child(4) { width: 90px; }\n    .page-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 62px;\n      bottom: 8px;\n      width: 29px;\n      height: 18px;\n      background: #a4c91b;\n      border-radius: 11px;\n      color: white;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      text-align: center;\n      transform: rotate(-4deg);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"topline\">•••••••••• We’re trying to save the earth! ••••••••••••••••••••• <span class=\"unit\">UNIT 13</span> •••••••••••</div>\n\n    <section class=\"exercise-row\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">2c</div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Fill in the blanks with the correct forms of the phrases in the box.</div>\n      <div class=\"phrase-box\">\n        <span>put to good use</span>\n        <span>build ... out of</span>\n        <span>pull down</span>\n        <span>set up</span>\n        <span>known for</span>\n        <span>not only ... but also</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"answer-area\">\n        <ol class=\"answers\">\n          <li>Amy Hayes lives in the UK. Many of the old buildings in her neighborhood<br>\n            were <span class=\"blank w55\"><span class=\"answer-word\">pulled down</span></span>.\n          </li>\n          <li>All the rubbish and old things in Amy’s neighborhood were then<br>\n            <span class=\"blank w62\"><span class=\"answer-word\">put to good use</span></span> when Amy built her house.\n          </li>\n          <li>Amy is very creative. She <span class=\"blank w43\"><span class=\"answer-word\">built</span></span> her front gate <span class=\"blank w48\"><span class=\"answer-word\">out of</span></span><br>\n            rocks and old glass bottles. She put an old boat on top of her house.\n          </li>\n          <li>Jessica Wong sells her bags in a small shop, but she has also <span class=\"blank w48\"><span class=\"answer-word\">set up</span></span><br>\n            an online business to sell them.\n          </li>\n          <li>Though Jessica’s bags are made from old clothes, her bags are<br>\n            <span class=\"blank w55\"><span class=\"answer-word\">known for</span></span> being cute and useful.\n          </li>\n          <li>Wang Tao <span class=\"blank w43\"><span class=\"answer-word\">not only</span></span> makes large pieces of metal art that look like<br>\n            animals or humans, <span class=\"blank w55\"><span class=\"answer-word\">but also</span></span> makes smaller pieces for the home.\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"exercise-row small-exercise\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">2d</div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Underline the words in the passage based on the words below. What are<br>the differences?</div>\n      <div class=\"word-grid\">\n        <div class=\"top\">rethink</div><div class=\"top\">reuse</div><div class=\"top\">unusual</div><div class=\"top\">recycling</div><div class=\"top\">building&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; creation/creativity</div>\n        <div>think</div><div>use</div><div>usual</div><div>recycle</div><div>build&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; create</div>\n        <div>special</div><div>recent</div><div>environment</div><div>important</div><div>protect&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; inspire</div>\n        <div>especially</div><div>recently</div><div>environmental</div><div>importantly</div><div>protection&nbsp;&nbsp; inspiration</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"exercise-row small-exercise make-list\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">2e</div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Make a list of things that need to be done to save the environment.<br>\n        Which things can be done by common people every day? Which things<br>\n        have to be done by governments and organizations? Discuss these with<br>\n        your group.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"handwriting\">[illegible]</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"exercise-row chart-section\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">3a</div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Think about the environment in your town/city and complete the chart<br>below.</div>\n      <div class=\"questions\">\n        Which parts of the town/city have a nice environment? Why are they nice?<br>\n        Which parts need to be improved? Why?\n      </div>\n      <table>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Good environment</th>\n          <th>Why?</th>\n          <th>Bad environment</th>\n          <th>Why?</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number\">103</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
